  "id": "section-929",
  "title": "关于夏收的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-309.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>309)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　积极行动起来夏收夏种，目前正进入两夏大忙季节，南方已开始收割。今年全国夏收作物生长很好。今年的夏收，各级领导同志应特别重视，立即投入夏收夏种。各地要组织学生、机关干部、工人、解放军，以劳力、畜力、技术力量，大力支持人民公社，做到颗粒归仓。严防阶级敌人破坏。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-308.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-310.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
